{
 "kind": "bt.tree",
 "id": "lane-sweep-pair-left",
 "name": "Lane-sweep pair: left robot",
 "env": "onboard",
 "description": "For the left start position, on the rear wall: fill the rear CELL for the second TIP, sweep the rear spill, and PARK.",
 "meta": {
  "start": "left",
  "partner": "lane-sweep-pair-right"
 },
 "defs": {
  "len": "bots.me.dimensions.length",
  "flip": "if(bots.me.shooter.facing == 'front', 180, 0)",
  "hiveX": "-0.3237",
  "stand": "len / 2 + field.flowerHalfSize + 0.02",
  "rearFlower": "pose(-0.5942, -1.7282 + stand, 90)",
  "park": "pose(-(field.half - len / 2 - 0.09), -0.8954, 180)",
  "angledRear": "pose(hiveX - 0.62, -1.17, 129.4 + flip)",
  "parkLeft": "pose(park.x, -0.8954 - 0.33, park.headingDeg)"
 },
 "root": {
  "sequence": {
   "children": [
    {
     "id": "steps",
     "parallel": {
      "policy": "any",
      "children": [
       {
        "id": "finish",
        "note": "When the clock shows 3 s, the last step starts, whatever step is running then.",
        "ref": "auto.clockAtMost",
        "params": {
         "sec": 3
        }
       },
       {
        "sequence": {
         "children": [
          {
           "id": "s1",
           "ref": "auto.drive",
           "params": {
            "pose": "angledRear",
            "timeoutSec": 3
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s2",
           "note": "The camera wait keeps the robot from launching at the CELL before its partner's TIP raises it.",
           "ref": "auto.waitCell",
           "params": {
            "cell": "rear",
            "timeoutSec": 8
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s3",
           "ref": "auto.shoot",
           "params": {
            "count": 4,
            "timeoutSec": 2.5,
            "cell": "rear"
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s4",
           "ref": "auto.drive",
           "params": {
            "pose": "offset(rearFlower, 0, 0.2)",
            "timeoutSec": 3
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s5",
           "ref": "auto.drive",
           "params": {
            "pose": "rearFlower",
            "intake": "pollen",
            "timeoutSec": 1.5
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s6",
           "ref": "auto.push",
           "params": {
            "power": 0.35,
            "intake": "pollen",
            "timeoutSec": 2.2
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s7",
           "ref": "auto.drive",
           "params": {
            "pose": "angledRear",
            "timeoutSec": 3
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s8",
           "ref": "auto.shoot",
           "params": {
            "count": 4,
            "timeoutSec": 2.5
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s9",
           "note": "That volley tips the rear CELL. The robot watches the TIP and lets the spill reach the rear wall before it sweeps.",
           "ref": "auto.waitTip",
           "params": {
            "cell": "rear",
            "timeoutSec": 4
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s10",
           "ref": "auto.wait",
           "params": {
            "timeoutSec": 1.2
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s11",
           "note": "A blind sweep: a TIP spills the CELL where the robot can't see. scripts/plan-sweeps.ts records where the spill comes to rest over many simulated matches and writes the lanes that collect the most. Each lane ends early once the hopper is full.",
           "ref": "auto.sweep",
           "params": {
            "from": "angledRear",
            "role": "left",
            "lanes": [
             {
              "x": -1.565,
              "z": -1.115,
              "wall": null
             },
             {
              "x": -1.565,
              "z": -0.515,
              "wall": null
             },
             {
              "x": -0.365,
              "z": -1.115,
              "wall": null
             }
            ]
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s12",
           "note": "The right robot's third TIP raises the rear CELL again: launch what the sweep found, then sweep once more so that TELEOP starts with a full hopper.",
           "ref": "auto.drive",
           "params": {
            "pose": "angledRear",
            "timeoutSec": 3
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s13",
           "ref": "auto.shoot",
           "params": {
            "count": 4,
            "timeoutSec": 4,
            "cell": "rear"
           }
          },
          {
           "id": "s14",
           "note": "A blind sweep: a TIP spills the CELL where the robot can't see. scripts/plan-sweeps.ts records where the spill comes to rest over many simulated matches and writes the lanes that collect the most. Each lane ends early once the hopper is full.",
           "ref": "auto.sweep",
           "params": {
            "from": "angledRear",
            "role": "left",
            "lanes": [
             {
              "x": -1.565,
              "z": -1.115,
              "wall": null
             },
             {
              "x": -1.565,
              "z": -0.515,
              "wall": null
             },
             {
              "x": -0.365,
              "z": -1.115,
              "wall": null
             }
            ]
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "s15",
     "note": "Every drive to PARK runs the intake: the robot faces the alliance wall, where NECTAR from the LOADING ZONE collects, and a full hopper at the end of AUTO is a head start in TELEOP. LEAVE needs the robot clear of the wall by half its size plus 2 cm. The pose is 9 cm off the wall, which leaves margin for a 5 cm drive tolerance.",
     "ref": "auto.drive",
     "params": {
      "pose": "parkLeft",
      "intake": "all",
      "timeoutSec": 6
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
